---
// ChapterResult.astro - Chapter 4: The Result
// Stats: 5,000+ customers, 50+ MW installed, 25-year warranty, 4.8/5 rating
// Two paths: "For Your Home" and "For Your Shop or Business"
---

<section id="results" class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-[#0F2540] text-white relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Subtle gradient background effects -->
  <div class="absolute -top-40 -right-40 w-[600px] h-[600px] rounded-full bg-radial from-[#3E7CC9]/20 to-transparent blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute -bottom-40 -left-40 w-[600px] h-[600px] rounded-full bg-radial from-[#EA6B1F]/20 to-transparent blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Chapter Tag -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 reveal-fade">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/10 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#EA6B1F] mb-4">
        <span>Chapter 04</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>The Proven Numbers</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-medium text-white leading-tight">
        Real numbers on real roofs across Purvanchal.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-white/75 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
        Solar isn't an experiment anymore. Over five thousand families and business owners in our region have stopped renting electricity.
      </p>
