            class="w-full h-full object-cover transform hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#173257] via-[#173257]/30 to-transparent"></div>
          <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 px-3 py-1 bg-[#EA6B1F] text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-full shadow">
            Residential Solar
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6">
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-white">For Your Home</h3>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-white/80 leading-relaxed font-light">
              Designed for independent houses, duplexes, and villas in Varanasi, Mirzapur, and Prayagraj. Erase your summer power bills while keeping fans and air conditioners running all night.
            </p>

            <ul class="space-y-3 pt-2 text-sm text-white/90">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="text-[#EA6B1F] font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
                <span><strong>PM Surya Ghar Subsidy:</strong> Up to ₹78,000 direct credit into your bank account.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="text-[#EA6B1F] font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
                <span><strong>Payback in ~3.2 Years:</strong> The system pays for itself in power savings, followed by 20+ years of free electricity.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="text-[#EA6B1F] font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
                <span><strong>Terrace-Friendly Pergola:</strong> Elevated installation preserves your morning walk and terrace garden.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <a
            href="#calculator"
            class="btn-shimmer inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full py-3.5 px-4 rounded-xl text-white font-semibold text-sm bg-[#EA6B1F] hover:bg-[#F98A3D] shadow-lg shadow-[#EA6B1F]/20 transition-all"
          >
            Calculate Home Solar Subsidy
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Path 2: For Your Shop or Business -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-[#173257] to-[#0F2540] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/15 flex flex-col hover:border-[#3E7CC9]/60 transition-all duration-300 card-glow">
        <div class="relative h-60 w-full overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/commercial-solar-industrial.jpg"
            alt="Commercial rooftop solar setup on industrial warehouse and workshop"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover transform hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#173257] via-[#173257]/30 to-transparent"></div>
          <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 px-3 py-1 bg-[#3E7CC9] text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-full shadow">
            Commercial & Industrial
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6">
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-white">For Your Shop or Business</h3>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-white/80 leading-relaxed font-light">
              Ideal for carpet factories in Bhadohi, saree looms and retail showrooms in Varanasi, hospitals, hotels, and schools facing commercial electricity rates of ₹10–12/unit.
            </p>

            <ul class="space-y-3 pt-2 text-sm text-white/90">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="text-[#3E7CC9] font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
                <span><strong>40% Accelerated Depreciation:</strong> Significant income tax savings under Section 32 in the very first fiscal year.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="text-[#3E7CC9] font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
                <span><strong>Slash Diesel Generator Running:</strong> Cut expensive fuel costs during daytime grid fluctuations.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="text-[#3E7CC9] font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
                <span><strong>Custom HT/LT Solutions:</strong> 10 kW to 500+ kW systems with zero export and synchronizer options.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <a
            href="#calculator"
            class="btn-shimmer inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full py-3.5 px-4 rounded-xl text-white font-semibold text-sm bg-[#3E7CC9] hover:bg-blue-600 shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/20 transition-all"
          >
            Get Commercial ROI & Tax Plan
